# Keep the Docker build context lean: dependency trees and build outputs are
# recreated inside the image, and the git history is replaced by a throwaway
# index (the diffshub Dockerfile runs `git init` for moon's input hashing).
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
# Host build outputs: moon rebuilds or restores them from its cache mount,
# and copying them in would bust the source layer on every local build.
**/dist
**/.open-next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.moon/cache
.agents/ignore
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.env*
**/.env*
